OL,3,ASnapchat and Instagram grooming
OL,4,Abecoming 'easier'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police's child
OL,7,Fexploitation prevention officer Andri
OL,8,FNicolau said children as young as five
OL,9,Fcan be targeted through social media,
OL,10,Fgaming and messaging platforms. She
OL,11,Furged parents to encourage kids to ask
OL,12,Ffor help without fear of blame or
OL,13,Fpunishment.
OL,15,FThe warning comes after three men were
OL,16,Fjailed for grooming a 17-year-old girl
OL,17,Fon Snapchat before raping her.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
